{"id":"f700bea2b74485f2","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-lob-sentence-construction.md","title":"Löb Sentence Construction","display":"ex-lob-sentence-construction — Löb Sentence Construction","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-lob-sentence-construction","aliases":["92-ex-lob-sentence-construction"],"display":"ex-lob-sentence-construction — Löb Sentence Construction","depends_on":["[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 110（PDF 127）","source_status":"原书固定点方法的本地构造"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-lob-sentence-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-lob-sentence-construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-lob-sentence-construction — Löb Sentence Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 110（PDF 127）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书固定点方法的本地构造"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (target sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variable, free-variable function, and substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LobSent}_G\\)</span> (Löb-sentence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lob\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_\\varphi\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\to\\varphi),\\qquad\n\\theta_\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists L_\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nL_\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_\\varphi,\n\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(L_\\varphi,\\varphi)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}lob\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\theta_\\varphi\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\to\\varphi),\\qquad\n\\theta_\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta_\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists L_\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\nG\\vdash\\bigl(\nL_\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta_\\varphi,\n\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner},v_0)\n\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{LobSent}_G(L_\\varphi,\\varphi)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi\">\\(L_\\varphi\\)</span> : 关于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的Löb句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi\">\\(L_\\varphi\\)</span>断言&quot;如果我可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>成立&quot;</li>\n<li>对角化得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash L_\\varphi\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\">\\(G\\vdash L_\\varphi\\leftrightarrow(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner L_\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对角引理而非一次朴素的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>应用保证这里谈论的是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi\">\\(L_\\varphi\\)</span>自己的码</li>\n<li>在标准可导性条件下，Löb定理在元语言层面给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash L_\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash L_\\varphi\\)</span>当且仅当<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这展示了可证性逻辑的自引用性质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>修正公式中缺少反斜线的 qquad。实例针对已指定内部公式；Gödel/Henkin/Löb 的存在性只用对角引理，Rosser 不可判定性还须使用其指定证明比较构造。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 110（PDF 127）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(v_0)\\)</span> 再作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span>，与直接构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\bar n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\bar n)\\)</span>，可能采用不同绑定变量名。由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>及<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>，两者仅保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价，并可由一阶逻辑证明双条件；把该双条件与对角引理的双条件组合后才得到相应固定点谓词。这里未把不同字符串或它们的 Gödel 码当成字面相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-lob-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"71758b63b2ee2736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-lob-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"